  universityChannels: 'Indian universities accept Cambridge A-Level via CBSE-equivalent recognition by Association of Indian Universities — A-Level Physics + Chemistry + Mathematics supports JEE Main / Advanced preparation for IIT entry; A-Level Biology + Chemistry + Physics supports NEET preparation for AIIMS medical entry; A-Level Economics + Business supports CAT preparation for IIM management entry. UK Russell Group accepts Cambridge A-Level or IB Diploma via UCAS with October 15 Oxbridge early deadline. US Ivy League + UC system via Common Application with SAT/ACT + AP portfolio. Canadian U15 via OUAC or as international student. Australian G8 via direct entry. Personalised university guidance sessions with the Head of Academics including UCAS personal statement coaching + Oxbridge admissions test preparation (MAT, PAT, ENGAA, TSA, HAT) and Common App essay coaching.',
  cambridgeCardDescription: 'Smartious\'s primary offer for Indian families. Cambridge IGCSE (Years 10-11) and Cambridge A-Level (Years 12-13) delivered as live online classes with afternoon India delivery matching Nairobi lunchtime teaching. Private candidate examination registration at Cambridge Assessment International Education authorised centres across India (British Council + international schools). Pathway accepted by all Indian universities via CBSE-equivalent recognition (Association of Indian Universities), UK Russell Group via UCAS, US Ivy League via Common Application, Canadian U15, Australian G8.',
  britishCurriculumSuits: 'Indian and NRI families targeting Cambridge IGCSE + A-Level pathway. Best fit for: (1) fee-sensitive families switching from Mumbai DAIS/Ecole Mondiale/JBCN, Delhi NCR BSD/Pathways/Heritage, Bangalore TISB/CIS/Indus/Oakridge, Hyderabad Oakridge/Chirec, Chennai AISC/Chennai British, Pune Symbiosis/Mercedes-Benz — (2) NRI returnee families from Gulf/UK/US maintaining Cambridge/IB continuity, (3) tier-2 city families without local Cambridge/IB access, (4) tech/pharma/automotive corporate rotational families, (5) families targeting UK Russell Group + US Ivy League + Canadian U15 + Australian G8 international universities.',
  britishCurriculumDelivery: 'Live online classes IST 11:30 AM – 2:30 PM (matching Nairobi 9 AM – 12 PM teaching), small groups 4-6 students. Cambridge examinations at India-wide authorised centres.',
  ibDiplomaSuits: 'Indian and NRI families targeting IB Diploma\'s breadth. DAIS + Ecole Mondiale + JBCN + Oberoi Mumbai, BSD + Pathways + Heritage Delhi NCR, TISB + CIS + Indus + Oakridge Bangalore alternative. Best fit for families targeting US Ivy League + Canadian U15 + holistic university applications.',
  ibDiplomaDelivery: 'Live online IB DP classes across all six subject groups plus Theory of Knowledge and Extended Essay supervision.',
  americanCurriculumSuits: 'Indian and NRI families targeting US universities via Common Application. AES Delhi + ASB Mumbai + AISC Chennai alternative. Best fit for: NRI returnee families from Silicon Valley US, US-pathway-focused families, tech corporate rotational families (Google India, Microsoft India, Amazon India, Meta India, Apple India).',
  americanCurriculumDelivery: 'American Curriculum with AP courses Grades 9-12, SAT/ACT preparation, Common App essay coaching.',
  founderBioCountrySpecific: 'Alfred Ouko founded Smartious in 2019 to make international qualifications (Cambridge, IB, American, Ontario OSSD) accessible to families across emerging markets and international corporate rotational communities at online-delivery fees below traditional international school and existing UK online school competitor pricing. Indian families join students in 20 other countries — from Mumbai Bandra Kurla to Bangalore Whitefield, Delhi Chanakyapuri to Dubai Downtown, Chennai OMR to Kuala Lumpur Mont Kiara, Pune Hinjewadi to London Kensington.',
  founderUniversitySpecialism: 'Alfred holds a BEd in Mathematics and Physics — Smartious\'s Cambridge A-Level and IB Diploma STEM subjects are led personally when needed. Head of Academics supervises curriculum delivery and university placement strategy per family across Indian universities (IIT, AIIMS, IIM entrance preparation via A-Level integration), UK Russell Group (UCAS + Oxbridge coaching), US Ivy League (Common App + SAT/ACT), Canadian U15, and Australian G8 destinations.',

